  "descriptionMarkdown": "This train allows different robot networks to request items from your main base. \nThe train will be loaded accordingly, and each requester filters out the items needed at the outpost. \n\nWhen the train leaves the provider, further requesters can't activate.\nIf requested items aren't availiable, the train will wait two minutes and supply what it can. \n\nSetup:\n\nPlace the provider station in you main base, and requester stations in your outposts. Connect all stations with red wire.\nDefine the items you want to request and M value for each requester station at the front combinator.\n(If anything falls below M, a train is requested)\nDon't forget to activate the combinator!!\nThe train uses a refuel stop with the new refuel station symbol.\n\nNote:\n\nIf you want to use multiple supply trains (only works in different networks), station names need to be different for each network.\n\nIf you like it consider supporting me :) https://buymeacoffee.com/jebediah",
